{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576690/extras/380df731200c556e0f25770e93b2323a.avif?t=1766482121\" width=574 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Laugh</strong> is a horror game with <strong>7 different endings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY:</strong><br>The game follows three mischievous teenagers who enjoy hanging out, laughing, and playing games at one of their friends' houses. But then...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576690/extras/5ae8b5e8ce51452c1c045402e5650a6d.poster.avif?t=1766482121\" width=350 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576690/extras/5ae8b5e8ce51452c1c045402e5650a6d.webm?t=1766482121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576690/extras/5ae8b5e8ce51452c1c045402e5650a6d.mp4?t=1766482121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Retro Horror Experience</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a horror atmosphere with <strong>PS1-style graphics</strong> and <strong>pixel art visuals</strong> that enhance the eerie feeling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Uncover all <strong>7 different endings</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfa <strong>Dynamic Menu Changes</strong> \u2013 The <strong>main menu evolves</strong> based on the endings you've unlocked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe <strong>Auto-Save Feature</strong> \u2013 Your progress is automatically saved, allowing you to <strong>continue and explore different endings</strong> without starting over!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Almost There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3576690/eae6d059419bfd1e4739d28eb0799615960535be.jpg"},{"name":"True ending!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3576690/3018b9a68b932a491e8f2338ee13c86fdd7fbe65.jpg"},{"name":"Good ending 1?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3576690/51ff9e0c98966ff3ddbbb42b4156fceb4f0afb09.jpg"},{"name":"Be careful, there's a car!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3576690/bb842211b8b233a0bebcbf8ecb0ad396f9009eb6.jpg"},{"name":"Alternative ending :)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3576690/2749c9a40b07ef8ceda2620b65dbe4671fc877dc.jpg"},{"name":"Good ending 2!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3576690/f8ae8c673a860f4f9b47c2a64064f595df6b98fd.jpg"},{"name":"Kil#/@r ending!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3576690/288eabb21a938620edda836a8596890e3bcc099d.jpg"},{"name":"Secret ending!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3576690/71f5aae31d436e0cc5b0eb413a29628391b4f39d.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576690?t=1766482121","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576690?t=1766482121","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576690/e5f83042b2ecccf7038dc5545ce9f156cbef5071/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766482121","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576690/e5f83042b2ecccf7038dc5545ce9f156cbe